    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Problem\n\n_SQL Server_ ( and others ? ) use `CREATE OR ALTER` instead of `CREATE OR REPLACE`. Would it be appropriate to incorporate it here?\nhttps://github.com/neovim/neovim/blob/7c9222f45eb731301bc1421cca96313a2034c12a/runtime/ftplugin/sql.vim#L436\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nThe `]}` normal mode keyboard shortcut finds `create or alter`.",
