            "body": "Sorry for not reading the docs first.\n\nIf anyone comes behind me, the below works in the `init.lua`.\n```lua\n  vim.g.ftplugin_sql_statements = \"create,alter,create or alter\" -- :h ft_sql\n```\nGoing back and forth if it would be beneficial to have it as the default ( at least the `or alter` section ).",
